{
  "_comment": "v7 PILOT pool (24 scenes) — dry run before the 5000-scene production pool (pool_2x_v7_cpu.json). Content: panel_cluster_v7 composer (owner-approved r4 form, ported byte-identical to the prototype per research_log/v7_composer_defects_integration_plan.md). Defects: unified instance schema + record_instances=true + hot_spot/dark_blob thermal defects + broken-trace carving + erosion knobs (dots terminal config from the dots-pilot). Noise: field_noise_burst four upgrades (row-stripe FPN, true 1/f^alpha low-freq field, static per-pixel FPN, AR(1) grain) per research_log/v7_noise_operator_integration_plan.md. Run this pool, audit via scripts/audit_v7_tcforge_gates.py (must match the prototype's 7/8 gate bar, G5 pre-known marginal), and visually review the full-chain/defect-closeup sheets BEFORE running the production pool or deleting v6. Seed 20260901 is disjoint from v6 (960960), dots_pilot (20260714) and bench48 (20260708). hole_edge_fraction=0.12 and directed isolated/embedded dot placement are open placeholders pending this pilot's visual read (see integration plan report). lowfreq_c/vignette_c noise amplitudes are open pending this pilot's audit_synth_noise.py pass against the real-noise measurements.",
  "dataset": "ThermalChipPhantom_v7_pilot",
  "engine": "TCForge",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "scale": 2,
  "lr_shape": [480, 640],
  "hr_shape": [960, 1280],
  "pixel_size_um": 20.0,
  "spatial_resolution_um": 20.0,
